@startuml Sequence_BackupExport
title Backup Export with Metadata + Checksum ([Unreleased])

actor Merchant
participant "SettingsPage" as UI
participant "BackupExportService" as SVC
participant "AppLockService" as Lock
participant "WalCheckpointService" as WAL
participant "BackupEncryptionService" as Enc
database "SQLite (SQLCipher)" as DB
participant "OS Share Sheet" as Share

Merchant -> UI: Tap "Backup" + toggle encrypt + enter PIN
UI -> SVC: exportWithMetadata(\n  encrypt: true, pin: "123456",\n  shareSubject: "Promsell Backup",\n  onProgress: updateProgress)

SVC -> Lock: requireSensitiveSession()
alt store PIN on + session locked
    Lock --> SVC: throw BusinessRuleError("AppLockRequired")
    SVC --> UI: error
end

== PIN Validation (if encrypt) ==
alt pin is empty
    SVC --> UI: throw StateError("PIN_REQUIRED")
else pin.length < 6
    SVC --> UI: throw StateError("PIN_TOO_SHORT")
end

== Size Preflight ==
SVC -> SVC: dbSize = File(dbPath).length()
alt dbSize > 512 MB
    SVC --> UI: throw StateError("BACKUP_TOO_LARGE")
end

== WAL Checkpoint ==
SVC -> UI: onProgress(checkpointing)
SVC -> WAL: forceTruncate()
WAL -> DB: PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)\n(exclusive lock)
DB --> WAL: CheckpointResult
WAL --> SVC: WAL truncated

== Copy ==
SVC -> UI: onProgress(copying)
SVC -> SVC: copy dbFile → temp snapshot

== Checksum ==
SVC -> UI: onProgress(checksumming)
SVC -> SVC: checksum = SHA-256(snapshotFile)

== Schema Version ==
SVC -> DB: PRAGMA user_version
DB --> SVC: schemaVersion (e.g., 32)

== Metadata ==
SVC -> SVC: BackupMetadata(\n  schemaVersion, appVersion,\n  createdAt: ISO-8601,\n  dbSizeBytes, checksumSha256,\n  encrypted: true)
SVC -> SVC: write .meta.json sidecar

== Encrypt (optional) ==
alt encrypt == true
    SVC -> UI: onProgress(encrypting)
    SVC -> Enc: encryptFile(sourcePath, pin, outputPath)
    Enc --> SVC: encrypted .enc file
end

== Share ==
SVC -> UI: onProgress(sharing)
SVC -> Share: SharePlus.share([.db/.enc, .meta.json])
Share --> Merchant: Share sheet (user saves to cloud/USB)

SVC -> UI: onProgress(done)
SVC --> UI: BackupExportResult(filePath, metadata, metadataPath)
UI --> Merchant: Show "Backup complete" + lastBackupAt

@enduml
